{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026H6QiEjbZBR1794527834.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中芯國際第三季，按年多賺1.2倍。</p><p></p><p>純利4.2億美元，按季下跌一成。期內收入31.9億美元，按年上升三成三，較第一季增加逾百分之6。毛利率按季擴闊4.6個百分點，至百分之29.9。</p><p></p><p>集團預期第四季收入，按季增長至少百分之4，毛利率介乎百分之26至28。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:39:13.778052+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T23:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T16:37:58.033029+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T00:32:39.246013+00:00","content_hash":"8c9ef3ddb1c5810f4e6fe589423a8d94dde9f62034f9474018514d520bcd24c8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T00:39:13.778052+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}